===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|categorize|ation}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˌkæt.ə.ɡɚ.əˈzeɪ.ʃən/|a=GA}}
* {{IPA|en|/ˌkæt.ə.ɡər.aɪˈzeɪ.ʃən/|a=RP}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A [[group]] of things arranged by [[category]]; a [[classification]].
# The [[process]] of [[sorting]] or [[arranging]] things into categories or [[class]]es.
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=w:James Gleick|title=Wikipedia's Women Problem|journal=New York Review of Books|date=29 Apr 2013
|passage=It’s fair to say that Wikipedia has spent far more time considering the philosophical ramifications of '''categorization''' than Aristotle and Kant ever did.}}

